From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: NBA2K14 Android port <nba2k14-android@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Wed, 25 Nov 2026 18:54:48 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 39/40] Export frames to an Android surface through a socket

Adds NBA2K14_FRAME_SOCKET=<path>: runs without X11 (SDL offscreen,
Vulkan headless surface) and hands each frame to the
Android app through a shared memfd. Without the variable nothing
changes.
